INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(968,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5602868','Advances in paediatrics in 2016: current practices and challenges in allergy, autoimmune diseases, cardiology, endocrinology, gastroenterology, infectious diseases, neonatology, nephrology, neurology, nutrition, pulmonology.','Caffarelli C, Santamaria F, Di Mauro D, Mastrorilli C, Montella S, Bernasconi S.','2017','moebius acgh antipyretics reliever endotypes montella montella schoolchildren tachimoto allergology emollients lukewarm cleansers detergents preservatives perfumes eroded exuding ciclosporin ciclosporin nle extractable ssb nle savino nle ssb nle nle fatemi pleurisy cholecalciferol vitd sledai eclam vitd sledai eclam sledai eclam vitd embryopathy prenatally neurocognition chds conotruncal chds teratogens chds chds novelties strambi dionne strambi isometric staminal omnitrope injective replenish stemness embryological endodermic reprogrammable nurtured mesodermic amnion haecs omnitrope omnitrope omnitrope omnitrope craniopharyngioma omnitrope genotropin enteropathy gliadin ttg ttg tola ttg ttg ttg dgp ttg dgp ttg dgp khatib ttg ttg ttg westernization gliadin asds calderoni asds mustalahti nenna aura aura fgids fgids figds fgids fgids fgids fgids fgids salvatore fgids domperidone ondasetron cyproheptadine propanolol pizotifen lactulose disimpaction rumination dyschezia madani cyproheptadine fgids cig nig cyproheptadine cig nig nig presumptively enterochromaffin cyproheptadine aktar mpv agglutination mpv mpv mpv mpv karaman unpasteurized mm3 mm3 pancytopenia mm3 mm3 pancytopenia houten immunoxpert immunoxpert cebey superinfection antipyretics antipyretics antipyretics antipyretics phobia antipyretic syrup lubrano salbutamol inhaler aspirating flick cuddling vapocoolants henoch schonlein leukocytoplastic dalt mump mump salbutamol euglycemia tiberi dysglycemia transmits wirelessly dysglycemia hegarty neurosensory dehdashtian intratracheal salbutamol insure salbutamol insure insure