INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(1025,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9885104','A scoping review of the risk factors and strategies followed for the prevention of COVID-19 and other infectious diseases during sports mass gatherings: Recommendations for future FIFA World Cups.','Alhussaini NWZ, Elshaikh UAM, Hamad NA, Nazzal MA, Abuzayed M, Al-Jayyousi GF.','2023','sportdiscus charted celebration airport devi priya stadiums stadiums architecturally stadiums spectators collating sportdiscus reclaim sportdiscus h3n2 larva migrans rickettsiosis parnell mantero olympic paralympic hemophilus annear olympic paralympic spectator pox shipway tourists alshahrani pshenichnaya tbe memish olympic abubakar olympic cricket gaines olympic paralympic olympic paralympic equatorial olympics hkp gautret olympics vyklyuk gautret olympic paralympic olympics romaihi mccloskey olympic paralympic mccloskey baseball baseball aitsi selmi drury tawfiq pilgrimage denes uefa championship chiampas ibiebele hassanzadeh farzin eberhardt pilgrimage baseball spitting peaking etiquette arrivals flights etiquette cleanse sidelines parnell flights mantero exportation catering medisys advisers traveler itineraries annear arrivals facemasks spectator perimeter alshahrani traveler stockpiles disinfecting pshenichnaya memish guarded abubakar geosentinel eurotravnet gaines aeromedical larva migrans meningitides piddly importing airport airport vhf gaborone stadia airport gengue peaking geosentinel geosentinel itinerary spitting hksi abided inbound hksi footage spitting issuance outbound hksi disallowed congregated competitions spectators canceling ftocc etiquette abstaining towels bottles showering geosentinel gautret etiquette handkerchiefs vyklyuk thermometer imagers gautret olympics trave romaihi mccloskey collates olympic collating hpzone qsurveillance polyclinic polyclinic olympicparalympic hotels olympicparalympic aider mccloskey spectators staggering arrivals departures refreshments buffet etiquett